# Design system (platform-wide)

Follow `/DESIGN.md` for all frontend work.

## Required

- `/` is always the **marketing home** (community glass navbar). Authenticated members use **`/dashboard`** (`layouts/dashboard.blade.php`). Platform admins use **`/admin`** (`layouts/admin.blade.php` — same sidebar/topbar shell pattern).
- Other member pages still use community glass navbar until migrated to dashboard shell.
- Brand tokens: indigo primary, orange→amber CTA gradients, emerald trust/success, slate neutrals — via CSS `@theme` / Tailwind tokens only.
- Event lists use the rich media event card pattern on marketing surfaces; dashboard nearby uses `x-dashboard.event-card`.
- Forms: rounded-xl/2xl, indigo focus rings; Create Event CTAs orange gradient.
- EN/AR + `dir` sync; prefer logical CSS (`start`/`end`, `ms`/`me`).
- Atmosphere utilities in `app.css`: `animate-aurora`, `animate-float`, `bg-dots`, `bg-dots-slate`, `bg-noise`, `fancy-scroll`, plus `.dash-sidebar` / `.dash-main` / `.dash-hero`.

## Do not

- Invent one-off color themes per page
- Ship flat gray admin-panel aesthetics on member surfaces
- Duplicate a second navigation chrome

When unsure, match `resources/views/components/community/*` and `DESIGN.md`.
